# The hands that signed Welte rolls, as authority records: persons known by a signature,
# at present on the red rolls of the Condon collection at Stanford. Each hand has an IRI
# of its own, e.g. /fritz, which is answered with the one document that describes them
# all; 303, since the IRI names a person and the document describes one. The document is
# served from GitHub Pages; moving it means changing this file only.

Options +FollowSymLinks
RewriteEngine on

RewriteRule ^$ https://pfefferniels.github.io/condon-dates/hands.jsonld [R=302,L]
RewriteRule ^([a-z0-9-]+)$ https://pfefferniels.github.io/condon-dates/hands.jsonld [R=303,L]
